Word list license: fr-CA (Français (Canada))
============================================

The files words.txt and words-ascii.txt in this folder are made from the sources below.
Hekate changed this source. Hekate filtered the words and shortened the list.
The license of each source applies to the words that come from that source.

This list is a copyleft work. It keeps the license of LibreOffice French dictionary (Hunspell fr, Grammalecte 7.7) (MPL-2.0). Every changed copy of the list must use that license too.

Sources
-------

1. Google Books Ngram v3, French (fre) (version: 20200217, role: frequency)
   License: CC BY 3.0
   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
   Home page: https://storage.googleapis.com/books/ngrams/books/datasetsv3.html

2. LibreOffice French dictionary (Hunspell fr, Grammalecte 7.7) (version: commit 32b006a2c22a4ac7e8ed3f03346f7b3d85a970a4, role: lexicon)
   License: MPL-2.0
   License text: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/MPL/2.0/
   Home page: https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries/tree/master/fr_FR

3. Hekate Québec word list (version: 2026-10-07, role: extra)
   License: MIT
   License text: https://opensource.org/license/mit
   Home page: https://github.com/madsmadsen/hekate

